  "rejection": {
    "date": "2026-08-23",
    "verdict": "Austen rejected the R2.1 result on visual review: the enlarged technical site never became a believable place. Stage reads as a tiny marker, terrain is an undifferentiated field, the river reads as a flat trench, and the missing grove leaves no canopy, enclosure, or intimacy.",
    "evidence": "docs/superpowers/specs/handoff-assets/2026-08-23-blossom-scene-rebuild/current-overview.png (commit 03eafb1997e7)",
    "disposition": "Historical rejection of the August build. Superseded for authoring by the September 5 hanami redesign request; final visual acceptance remains unrecorded."
  },
